This project is designed for easy local execution of the demo.
Required environment – Java: Eclipse Temurin JDK 8.0.412.8

Execution steps
Step 1: Run run-demo.bat to start the Spring Boot application.
Step 2: Open starter-code/index.html in your browser to view the frontend interface.

By modifying the definitions in json/predefined.json, you can generate corresponding modeling element blocks.

Caution – The application uses port 8080. If another process is already using this port, please either change the port number or stop the conflicting process.